WEBVTT

00:00:00.329 --> 00:00:06.119
<b>Acerca de</b> (About) shows your version and how long you get updates

00:00:06.302 --> 00:00:08.811
If there is a new version, it lets you know here

00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:14.737
To open MiCaja on your phone or another computer in the store, use this address

00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:18.719
Or scan the QR code with your phone camera

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:25.216
To use your phone camera as a scanner, download and install the certificate
